  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The Psychic damage of your Dreadful Strike becomes 2d8. In addition, when you use the Dreadful Strike effect of your Dread Ambusher feature, you can cause one of the following additional effects.</p><p><strong>Sudden Strike.</strong> You can make another attack with the same weapon against a different creature that is within 5 feet of the original target and that is within the weapon’s range.</p><p><strong>Mass Fear.</strong> The target and each creature within 10 feet of it must make a Wisdom saving throw against your spell save DC. On a failed save, a creature has the &amp;Reference[Frightened] condition until the start of your next turn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-1EO1czD31TZtrQzN\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The damage of your <strong>Dreadful Strike</strong> activity will automatically scale as you level up.</p><p>To use the <strong>Sudden Strike</strong> effect simply make another attack.</p><p>The <strong>Mass Fear</strong> activity on this feature includes the save.</p></section>",
